    "wechat_html": "<section style='margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#fff;'><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzXgUR7FJnf11qGIo8nmKt6RxibXrb5s4RFb9UZ9UOHQy7fqQyI377Licw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'><section style='padding:0;'><img peitu='true' src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-renzhi-hub/main/assets/rss_covers/f9c092e990851291.jpg' style='width:100%;display:block;margin:30px 0;'><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你以为，维系一段感情，靠的是两个人眼里只有彼此吗？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这个认知，可能错了。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">一位诗人用他23年的婚姻，揭示了一个你从没想过的秘密。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他说：长久关系，需要一个共同的“第三件事”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">美国诗人唐纳德·霍尔（Donald Hall），与妻子简·肯扬（Jane Kenyon），共同生活了二十三年。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">肯扬同样也是一位诗人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们住在新罕布什尔州一栋老旧的农舍。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">在那里，他们写诗，享受乡村生活。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">肯扬在47岁时离世。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">霍尔回忆说，如果有人问他们，哪一年最好？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们会异口同声回答：“我们记得最少的那一年。”</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那些年里，有悲伤的时刻。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">比如肯扬父亲离世，霍尔罹患癌症，肯扬陷入抑郁。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">也有冒险的经历，他们去过中国、日本、印度旅行。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但他们<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">共同认为生命中最好的时光，是那些平静、重复的日常工作日。</strong></p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">不是凝视彼此，而是看向同一个方向</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">许多来访者不理解他们的生活。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">尤其是一些纽约的朋友，周末待完离开时会问：</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">“这里很美，有房子、池塘、小山，但你们平时都做什么呢？”</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">霍尔写下了他们的日常。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们很早起床。他给肯扬端咖啡到床上。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">她遛狗时，他开始写作。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">随后她上楼，在自己的书桌上写诗。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们一起吃午饭，然后午休。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">起来后，做些次要的事情。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他朗读给肯扬听，他们打没有比分的乒乓球。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">读邮件，再继续工作。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">吃晚饭，聊天，在客厅里相对而坐。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">读各自的书，然后睡觉。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">如果运气好，电话一整天都不会响。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">一年三百三十天，他们都在这栋老房子里。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">过着同样充满“冒险”的日常。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们做的，就是<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">爱。</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">但这种日常之爱的本质，并非浪漫小说里的情节。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">霍尔认为，<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">我们并没有把日子花在凝视彼此的眼睛上。</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那种凝视，只发生在亲密时刻。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">或者一方陷入困境时。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">多数时候，他们的目光是交汇缠绕着。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">共同看向一个“第三件事”。</p><section style=\"margin:35px 0; padding:15px 0 15px 20px; border-left:3px solid #111; background-color:#FAFAFA; color:#555; font-size:15px; line-height:1.9;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">对婚姻来说，“第三件事”<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">不可或缺。</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它可以是具体的事物、习惯、艺术、机构、游戏，甚至其他人。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它提供了一个共同沉浸或满足的场所。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">伴侣双方是独立的，但他们因共同关注这个“第三件事”而结合。</p></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">比如对霍尔和肯扬来说，家附近的池塘。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">就是他们多年的“第三件事”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">午睡后，他们会带着书和毯子，走到池塘边。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">肯扬在阳光下小憩。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">霍尔在树荫下阅读，偶尔记下笔记。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们不时游泳，在温暖中晾干身体。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那不是简单的休闲，那是两人关系的共同磁场。</p><section style=\"margin:50px 0 25px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5; padding-bottom:12px; display:flex; align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block; width:5px; height:18px; background-color:#111; margin-right:12px;\"></span><strong style=\"font-size:19px; color:#111; letter-spacing:1.5px;\">它不是装饰，而是支撑</strong></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">霍尔最深刻的观点是：</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">这个“第三件事”，不是关系的额外装饰。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它是陪伴的核心形式。它不可或缺，但并非不可替代。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">重要的是它存在，而不是它具体是什么。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">比如，当他们的池塘被污染毁坏后。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他们还有另一个“第三件事”：诗歌。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">诗歌的视角，连接和抚慰的力量。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">在他们最黑暗的时刻发挥了作用。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">肯扬罹患白血病，霍尔陪伴在她身边。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">写下了关于痛苦和虚弱的诗。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">在医院里，他甚至没有注意到。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">树叶何时变绿，何时又变黄。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">那是“没有季节的一年”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">他开始创作诗集《没有》（Without）。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">记录那种在沉闷、单调侵袭下的生活感受。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">当他读给肯扬听时，她虚弱地说：</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">“就是这样，珀金斯，你抓住了它。”</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">即使在临终的床边，诗歌依然是他们共同的<strong style=\"color:#000; font-weight:bold;\">陪伴。</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">长久的爱，不是紧盯着对方不放。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">而是找到一个共同的“第三件事”。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">它能让你们的目光交汇，指向同一个远方。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">现在，问问你自己。</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">你和你的伴侣，共同的“第三件事”是什么？</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0; line-height:2; color:#2c3e50; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:0.8px; text-align:justify;\">去发现它，去创造它。</p><section style='margin:45px 0 20px 0;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;'><section style='font-size:13px;color:#999;margin-bottom:12px;text-transform:uppercase;'>TAGS</section><section><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>爱情</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>婚姻</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>亲密关系</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>共同爱好</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>心理学</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>关系维护</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>唐纳德·霍尔</span><span style='display:inline-block;margin:0 10px 10px 0;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid #DCDFE6;color:#606266;font-size:12px;'>深度观察</span></section></section></section><img src='https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/3hAJnwuyZuicicZkgJBUCCaricdibomDBrTzk57DCmhVC16o9ILH0Tn1YPEiarfLRRQSVFN2mJdeYibGnBPialPIzvojw/0?wx_fmt=gif' style='width:100%;display:block;'></section>",
